OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FRecovery work has started after a
OL,7,Ftrain derailed in East Sussex - but
OL,8,FITV News has been told it will take
OL,9,Fweeks to repair.
OL,11,FThe railway between Lewes and Haywards
OL,12,FHeath will remain closed "for at least
OL,13,Fanother ten days", following the
OL,14,Fderailment - which left 20 people
OL,15,Finjured, two seriously.
OL,26,@tD@ZOUuD@QO]
