CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,7,Fstretch of track on Thursday afternoon
OL,8,F(13 August) when the three carriages
OL,9,Fof the Southern service from London
OL,10,FVictoria to Eastbourne derailed,
OL,11,Ftipped onto their sides - and slipped
OL,12,Fdown the embankment.
OL,14,FInvestigators have now left the scene,
OL,15,Fbut Network Rail and Southern Rail say
OL,16,Fit will be 'particularly difficult' -
OL,17,Fto reopen the railway and remove the
OL,18,Fstranded carriages.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FFences have been put up with
OL,7,Ffloodlights installed with fences
OL,8,Fsurrounding the site where the south's
OL,9,Fbiggest derailment in years took place
OL,10,Flast week.
OL,12,FDozens of Network Rail engineers are
OL,13,Fon site working round the clock to
OL,14,Fbegin recovery work.
OL,16,FEast Sussex Green Party has thanked
OL,17,Femergency and community responders to
OL,18,Fthe derailment which they described as
OL,19,F"shocking'.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FGreen Party Councillor Dr Wendy Maples
OL,7,Farrived at the scene soon after the
OL,8,Fderailment to support local residents.
OL,10,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian, she said: "I
OL,11,Ftook part in a government conversation
OL,12,Fabout civil preparedness and
OL,13,Fresilience only two days ago.
OL,15,F"We are finally seeing a growing
OL,16,Fawareness that without better support
OL,17,Ffor emergency services, and
OL,18,Fconnections between local authorities
OL,19,Fand community leaders, the resilience
OL,20,Fchallenges we are ` already ` facing
OL,21,Fcould overwhelm us.
OL,26,@rD@eOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,F"While our local fire service led the
OL,7,Frescue operation at the derailment,
OL,8,Fother firefighters were putting out
OL,9,Ffield fires in nearby Ringmer and
OL,10,FLittle Horsted. In the midst of the
OL,11,Ffifth heatwave this year, local
OL,12,Fresilience was truly tested."
OL,14,F"My understanding is that they've
OL,15,Falready done the initial
OL,16,Finvestigation," she added.
OL,18,F"So we should be hearing more about
OL,19,Fwhat the causes were for the
OL,20,Fderailment.
OL,26,@tD@]O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,F"However, there's lots to be done
OL,7,Fafter that, not least getting those
OL,8,Fcarriages back up on the rail - and
OL,9,Ftrying to do that in a sensitive way
OL,10,Fin what is a Site of Scientific
OL,11,FSpecial Interest.
OL,13,F"Those plants or animals that are on
OL,14,Fthe conservation list, are in habitats
OL,15,Fthat need to be preserved, and this is
OL,16,Fone of those spaces."
OL,18,FIman Choudhury who runs Western Cars
OL,19,Ftaxi service in Lewes described it as
OL,20,Fa "ghost town".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian he said: "I
OL,7,Fstarted at six o'clock this morning,
OL,8,Fand I've done one job at six and then
OL,9,FI came and sat here for a while, and
OL,10,Fit was 45 minutes to an hour.
OL,12,F"The front of the station is dead,
OL,13,Fthere's nobody there.
OL,15,F"It's keeping people away, people are
OL,16,Fusing alternative transport but
OL,17,Fthere's also more traffic on the road.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,F"On Saturday, a lot of people tried to
OL,7,Fget to Eastbourne because of Airborne,
OL,8,Fand they couldn't and they were stuck
OL,9,Fhere.
OL,11,F"The traffic going in was horrendous. (
OL,13,F"A lot of people coming in asking,
OL,14,F'can we get a taxi because the buses
OL,15,Fare not so frequent?'
OL,17,F"They want to book a taxi, but then
OL,18,Falso, because it's fixed price by the
OL,19,Fmeter, it's not affordable for
OL,20,Feveryone."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FJohn Whitehurst, Chief Executive
OL,7,FOfficer of Greater Thameslink Railway
OL,8,F(GTR), which operates Southern
OL,9,FRailway, said: "It has been an
OL,10,Fincredibly difficult time for our
OL,11,Fcustomers and colleagues, and our
OL,12,Fthoughts remain with everyone affected
OL,13,Fby this, particularly the family and
OL,14,Ffriends of those who have been injured.
OL,26,@qD@POU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,F"We recognise the impact this incident
OL,7,Fwill have on customers' journeys in
OL,8,Fthe days ahead, and we're working
OL,9,Fclosely with Network Rail to do
OL,10,Feverything we can to keep customers
OL,11,Fmoving while recovery work continues
OL,12,Fand the railway is restored safely.
OL,14,F"We know this recovery effort is not
OL,15,Fonly affecting rail customers, but
OL,16,Falso local communities around Lewes,
OL,17,Fand I'd like to thank them for their
OL,18,Fpatience and understanding while our
OL,19,Fteams work to restore the railway.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G10/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,F"We're providing replacement transport
OL,7,Fwhere needed and deploying additional
OL,8,Fcolleagues at stations to support
OL,9,Fcustomers and help them complete their
OL,10,Fjourneys.
OL,12,F"I thank customers for their patience
OL,13,Fand understanding while the railway
OL,14,Frecovers from this incident."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G11/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,FLucy McAuliffe, Network Rail's Sussex
OL,7,FRoute Director, said: "This is a
OL,8,Fcomplex recovery operation in a very
OL,9,Fdifficult location, and our teams are
OL,10,Fworking hard to recover the carriages
OL,11,Fand repair the railway, to resume
OL,12,Fservices safely as soon as we can.
OL,14,F"We know the closure is disruptive and
OL,15,Fthe recovery work also affects people
OL,16,Fliving close to the railway.
OL,26,@oD@WOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G12/13
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38413
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787033883
OL,3,CLewes derailment: Recovery work begins
OL,4,Cbut expected to 'take weeks to repair'
OL,6,F"I'm grateful for the support and
OL,7,Funderstanding of the local community
OL,8,Fwhile we carry out this work, and for
OL,9,Fthe patience of our customers during
OL,10,Fthis time.
OL,12,F"We are working around the clock to
OL,13,Fget this done.
OL,15,F"We will share more updates as the
OL,16,Frecovery work progresses."
OL,26,@xD@ZO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}  G13/13
